%% Checkout + price-change protection
flowchart TD
    V[Cart verified] --> CO[adapter.get_checkout]
    CO --> FT[Authoritative final_total]
    FT --> DR[Compute drift vs search estimate]
    DR --> BG{check_budget on final_total}
    BG -- over hard --> STOP[USER_REVIEW_REQUIRED, stop before pay]
    BG -- ok --> GUARD[Final transaction guard]
    GUARD --> PAY[Payment]
